note Qualification conductor: compose sha2.om, json.om, drv.om, then this unit under om2.
note All compilation uses this checkout's seed/out/omc. No GPU, live service or shell driver.
note Commands are tab-separated packed argv, never shell input. E/O/R/H/B placeholders are expanded.
text qempty ""
text qnl "\n"
text qtab "\t"
text qsp " "
text qhex "0123456789abcdef"
